      "mergeID": "602eb47583623e03b7a8bf5f",
      "mergedPostDetails": "One thing that has been driving me nuts and needs fixing is chairs/stations bugging out when instances are old enough. The instance owner gets stuck in them for late joiners and only gets fixed when the new user turns off chairs in the world or the person \"in the chair\" sits in it themselves and exits. this has to be repeated for every person entering the instance after the bug appears. \n\nAnother thing related to the bug is how the audio seems to flicker between the \"sitting\" users stationed position and true position.\n\n\nChairs also break locomotion for FBT and 3 point-tracking depending on how its set up in unity (locomotion seems the most likely to be the culprit)\n\nAll of the above has been an issue for months now. I do not recall when exactly it was introduced.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Stations/Chairs are broken in worlds with chairs on by default",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5fc4216ceaf1267182147cc9",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 4
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Pretty much identical issues reported also here:  https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/instance-master-apppears-to-be-sitting-in-a-chair-to-new-players-joining and https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/random-user-gets-stuck-in-station-for-new-joiners",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
