      "mergeID": "602eb3fb2489f457e4c550d8",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I can't remember which build that started this bug but this happens in a world with stations. New joiners sees a random user getting stuck in station. You can tell that the user is not in a sitting animation. You can also tell that the user's audio is splitting between the users actual location and the bugged station. \nIt's really bad for worlds such as car and plane worlds. It's hard to convince players since they themselves aren't aware that they are bugged and had to force kick them if action can't be done quickly.\nTo recreate this bug, join a world with people and also has stations. There's a chance that at a user is getting stuck in a station.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Random user gets stuck in station for new joiners",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "5fc4216ceaf1267182147cc9",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
